  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The X-Bow is a single-target, rapid-firing defense that is unlocked at Builder Hall 10. It attacks by shooting blue Elixir at units from a long range.",
    "It can be configured to two modes - Ground Mode, which can only target ground troops, or Air Mode, which can only target air units. Unlike the Home Village version, the X-Bow can never target both ground and air troops at the same time and has the same range in both modes, at 12 tiles."
  ],
